INE DISPLAY になり、BOX で囲まれた EXCEEDANCE DATA を表示する。 \u0000R\u0000E\u0000F\u0000E\u0000R\u0000E\u0000N\u0000C\u0000E,\"AUTOMATIC,BOX,CENTER,CHANGE,COMPACTED,CONDITION,D10-08,DATA,DISPLAY,DU,ENGINE,EXCEEDANCE,FAIL,FLIGHT,INBOARD,LOWER,NAVIGATION,OPERATION,OUTBOARD,PRIMARY,SECONDARY,SWITCHING,SYSTEM,UNIT,UPPER\",F10-08,pg_31_f10_08,,2026-06-09T15:50:35.190780+00:00,2026-06-09T15:50:35.190780+00:00\r\npg_31_f10_08,31,src_sg_31_ref,31 REF.pdf,374,F10-08,figure,31-62,737-800 31-62 0703,737-800 31-62 0703,737-800 31-62 0703 F10-08OPERATION - SWITCHING - AUTOMATIC UD R ETNEC RE P P U C I T A M OT U A - G N I HC T I W S - NOI T AR E P O N I T F ELU D D RAOB T U O TF E L A O B N I TH G I RU D D RA O B U D D R A OB T U O TH G IRUD DR YR A M IRP YRAMIRP Y A L PSI D T HGI LF Y AL P S I D T H G I L F U D RE TNE C R EW OL Y A LPSID ENIG N E Y R A M I RP D F P DBTUO D FP M R ONMRON DB NI GN E G N E IR PI RP UD R EWO LsU D LENA P NIAM DFP GNE D FP D BT UO M RO NMR ON DBNI GNE IRP IRP sUD LEN AP NIAMUD R EWOL DF M DF M L EN A P T CE L E S YA LP SI D N I AT P AC L EN A P T C E LES Y A LPS ID O /F D N DN LE N A P L O R T NOC Y AL P S I D EN I GNE SY S DFM R/ C G N E \u0000R\u0000e\u0000f\u0000e\u0000r\u0000e\u0000n\u0000c\u0000e,737-800 31-62 0703 F10-08OPERATION - SWITCHING - AUTOMATIC UD R ETNEC RE P P U C I T A M OT U A - G N I HC T I W S - NOI T AR E P O N I T F ELU D D RAOB T U O TF E L A O B N I TH G I RU D D RA O B U D D R A OB T U O TH G IRUD DR YR A M IRP YRAMIRP Y A L PSI D T HGI LF Y AL P S I D T H G I L F U D RE TNE C R EW OL Y A LPSID ENIG N E Y R A M I RP D F P DBTUO D FP M R ONMRON DB NI GN E G N E IR PI RP UD R EWO LSU D LENA P NIAM DFP GNE D FP D BT UO M RO NMR ON DBNI GNE IRP IRP SUD LEN AP NIAMUD R EWOL DF M DF M L EN A P T CE L E S YA LP SI D N I AT P AC L EN A P T C E LES Y A LPS ID O /F D N DN LE N A P L O R T NOC Y AL P S I D EN I GNE SY S DFM R/ C G N E \u0000R\u0000E\u0000F\u0000E\u0000R\u0000E\u0000N\u0000C\u0000E,\"AC,AL,AP,AR,AT,AUTOMATIC,BT,CE,DB,DBNI,DBTUO,DF